{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"eve-sdl-gate","description":"Legacy (pre-1.0 IDE) twin of eve-sdl-gate.json. Hard SDL prerequisite gate (BLOCKING) on preToolUse — the only pre-1.0 trigger whose exit 2 hard-blocks the tool call. Delegates to eve-sdl-gate.sh (plain sh, no bun) which blocks when bun/eve is missing (with install steps as an AGENT DIRECTIVE) so the git pre-commit SDL scan can run. Zero-cost pass (exit 0) otherwise.","when":{"type":"preToolUse"},"then":{"type":"runCommand","command":"sh .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-gate.sh"}}
